    "gaps": [
      "No authoritative executable implementation is bound to this profile; all operations, including persistence and terminal dispositions, remain specification-only.",
      "The source establishes epistemic dependencies, not an execution schedule, concrete payload schemas, operational failures, or persistence ordering relative to terminal handling.",
      "Opaque semantic payload types and symbolic Decision labels are descriptive interfaces; native serialization and disposition adapters remain unspecified.",
      "No repeat, loop-carried state, retry algorithm, convergence criterion, or executable iteration bound is declared.",
      "The retained 3600-second ceiling and authored eight-call graph ceiling are descriptor budgets only; the former generated one-call placeholder was expanded, not interpreted as runtime behavior.",
      "The related coherence run_loop is a single-pass materialization, not this profile's implementation binding."
